@startuml
skinparam participantPadding 20
skinparam boxPadding 10

box "Frontend" #White
participant "Chat UI" as UI
end box

box "FastAPI Backend" #LightBlue
participant "Execute Chat" as API
participant "Execution Engine" as Engine
end box

box "Services" #LightGray
participant "Supabase" as DB
participant "Google Calendar" as GC
participant "LLM (Groq)" as LLM
end box

UI -> API: POST /chat (message, AuthToken, GroqKey)
activate API

API -> API: Fetch Database Context (Tasks/Events)
API -> LLM: Initialize LLM (Context + Prompt + Tools)
activate LLM
LLM --> API: Tool Call Request
deactivate LLM

API -> Engine: Execute Tool Call
activate Engine
Engine -> DB: CRUD Operation
Engine -> GC: Google Calendar API Call
Engine --> API: Operation Result (Success/Error)
deactivate Engine

API -> LLM: Return Tool Result
activate LLM
LLM --> API: Human-Readable Reply
deactivate LLM

API --> UI: {reply: string}
deactivate API

@enduml